# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc2.rpy:2574
translate brazil ch5sc2_e7e5d1ca:

#   sy "When he turned, I was suddenly transfixed by the intensity of his gaze. I couldn’t move at all..."
    sy "Quando ele se virou, fiquei subitamente paralisado pela intensidade do seu olhar. Não conseguia me mexer..."

# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc2.rpy:2576
translate brazil ch5sc2_ab1aa629:

#   sy "He didn’t say anything... He just looked at me."
    sy "Ele não disse nada... Apenas olhou para mim."

# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc2.rpy:2577
translate brazil ch5sc2_0d5ff3e9:

#   sy "And then he launched himself into the sky and disappeared into the clouds."
