# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc2.rpy:2584
translate brazil ch5sc2_c6d3e29f:

#   mc "I can’t believe an Angel did that. Aren’t they supposed to be good? Just? Righteous?"
    mc "Não consigo acreditar que um anjo fez isso. Eles não deveriam ser bons? Justos? Íntegros?"

# game/chapters/chapter5/script/ch5sc2.rpy:2586
translate brazil ch5sc2_12271a37:

#   sy "I doubt anyone really knows what they are. Or what motivates them. So many different cultures have their own ideas about what Angels are."
